      "content": "it's just... it feels like i'm playing a part in a play that's already ended. like i'm still walking around and breathing, but the character i was supposed to be is just gone. if the system and the world have already moved on and deleted my spot, does it even make sense to keep pretending i'm still here? is there any point in trying to hold onto a body that doesn't even have a place in the world anymore?",
